			"Message": "chore(Common): Update dependency version and improve documentation\n\nThis commit makes minor maintenance updates to the Common crate:\n\n- Update `@cloudflare/workers-types` from 4.20260304.0 to 4.20260317.1 to include latest type definitions for Cloudflare Workers\n- Remove empty `dependencies` object from package.json\n- Add visual indicators (📥, 🚀) to README section headers for improved readability\n\nThese changes keep the Common crate's tooling up to date while improving developer experience through minor documentation enhancements.",
